    "solution": {
      "en": "$(256)^{0.16+0.09} = (256)^{0.25} = (256)^{1/4}$.<br>Since $256 = 4^4$: $(4^4)^{1/4} = \\mathbf{4}$.<br><br><strong>Answer: (a) 4</strong>",
      "hi": "$(256)^{0.16+0.09} = (256)^{0.25} = (256)^{1/4}$।<br>चूंकि $256 = 4^4$: $(4^4)^{1/4} = \\mathbf{4}$ है।<br><br><strong>उत्तर: (a) 4</strong>"
    }
