    "options": "(a) $4 + \\sqrt{15}$ &emsp; (b) $4 - \\sqrt{15}$ &emsp; (c) $8 + 2\\sqrt{15}$ &emsp; (d) $2 + \\sqrt{15}$",
    "solution": {
      "en": "Multiply numerator and denominator by $(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3})$:<br>$\\frac{(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3})^2}{5-3} = \\frac{5+3+2\\sqrt{15}}{2} = \\frac{8+2\\sqrt{15}}{2} = \\mathbf{4 + \\sqrt{15}}$.<br><br><strong>Answer: (a) $4 + \\sqrt{15}$</strong>",
      "hi": "अंश और हर को $(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3})$ से गुणा करें:<br>$\\frac{(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3})^2}{5-3} = \\frac{8+2\\sqrt{15}}{2} = \\mathbf{4 + \\sqrt{15}}$।<br><br><strong>उत्तर: (a) $4 + \\sqrt{15}$</strong>"
    }
  },
